  <h2>[&#32;OBJECT_OMEGA ]</h2>
  <p><b> [&#32;OBJECT_OMEGA ] </b></p>
  <p>Returns the list <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank"> [vector</a> omega ]</p>
